title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/groupphoto.jpg
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength.

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Left is interested in radical, transformative policies and even cooperation with the PLSRI and RKP(B).">Internationalist</span>!} strength: [+ left_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Center is a faction of Center Marxists, between reform and revolution.">Center</span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Labor's goal is economic reform and benefits for organized workers.">Labor</span>!} strength: [+ labor_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ labor_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Reformists are pragmatic participants in government, and seek to expand the welfare state and defend democracy.">Economist</span>!} strength: [+ reformist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ reformist_dissent : dissent +]

[? if neorevisionism > 0 : Neorevisionist strength: [+ neorevisionist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ neorevisionist_dissent : dissent +] ?]

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, reformist_advisor, labor_advisor, neorev_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


@remove_strumilin
title: Remove Strumilin
view-if: strumilin_advisor = 1
on-arrival: strumilin_advisor = 0; center_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main

Strumilin has been removed as an advisor. The Centrist faction disapproves.

