card-image: img/portraits/MartovHat.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: martov_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: martov_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Yuliy Martov is now an advisor.

