# reformist


@add_nikitin
title: Aleksey Nikitin
subtitle: Aleksey Nikitin is a lawyer, former Police Chief, and reformist-Menshevik. He advocated for harsh anti-Bolshevik measures during the Civil War. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Prussian Bulwark, Police Affairs ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/nikitin.jpg
tags: reformist_advisor
view-if: nikitin_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: nikitin_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; reformist_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

Aleksey Nikitin is now an advisor.

@add_potresov
title: Aleksandr Potresov
subtitle: Potresov has been a Social Democrat since the Emancipation of Labor group was founded. A long-time editor of Iskra, and now Novaya Zhizn, he is a die-hard reformist and anti-Bolshevik. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Prussian Bulwark, Negotiating with the Coalition ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/potresov.jpg
tags: reformist_advisor
view-if: potresov_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: potresov_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; reformist_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

